  "about_item": [
    "【Humanized Design】 This dog muzzle features a lightweight design that conforms to the contours of the face. The soft lining prevents chafing, and the basket design allows dogs to drink and pant freely. Highly accepted by dogs, it's suitable for extended wear.",
    "【Adjustable Size】 This is size L. First, you need to select the appropriate size based on your dog's Snout Length and Snout Circumference.. Simply slide the buckle to easily adjust the length, ensuring a snug fit around your dog's head.",
    "【Safe Material】 Made of food-grade liquid silicone, it's soft and gentle on the skin. The unique perforated structure ensures unobstructed breathing, and a specially designed drinking hole allows for normal drinking while wearing, providing peace of mind during outdoor activities.",
    "【Prevents Ingestion and Biting】 This dog muzzle effectively prevents dogs from picking up litter or licking foreign objects while outdoors, correcting bad behaviors such as chewing furniture. It combines training and protection.",
    "【Easy to Clean】 Made of soft silicone, it's easy to rinse, quick-drying, and hygienic, preventing bacterial growth. The multiple breathable holes prevent stuffiness, making it suitable for all seasons."
  ],
